OpenBB: Command Line Interface for the OpenBB Platform.

The openbb-cli package provides the interactive command-line interface
(CLI) client for the OpenBB Platform. It serves as an open-source data
router and investment research terminal, offering structured access to
multiple financial data providers under a single interface.

Features include:
- Standard single command mode for automation, scripts, and CI jobs.
- Batch processing mode reading NDJSON requests from standard input.
- Interactive REPL environment with tab-completion and custom menus.
- Support for local environments as well as remote OpenAPI servers.
